#X text 60 15 curve-editor as a waveshaper;
#X text 60 405 The curve redraws a 110 Hz sine as a new waveform.;
#X text 60 423 Signal from -1 to 1 reads the array left to right.;
#X text 60 441 The 0 to 1 output is recentred to -1 to 1 for the speaker.;
#X text 60 465 Bend the middle of the curve hard for obvious distortion.;
#X text 60 483 Preset box loads a gentle saturation shape. Volume down first.;
